{"version":1,"content":"<p>有「台版三上悠亞」嘅女星林莎（Lisa）早前宣布「着番衫」，最後一脫退出寫真界，令亞洲男士叫苦連天。</p><p>好在女神有心，各位襄王可以繼續發夢，尋日（16日）突然公開馬爾代夫度假美照，再度掀起熱議。</p><p>林莎深夜大晒全白細肩帶比堅尼索照，雪乳擠出深邃事業</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.532926+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.313250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.313250+00:00","content_hash":"91601efcff56670a177dcedec1934e3d23ac402d967d00c0a4fee86235d381ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}